{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1906","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Twin Friends"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You meet two new friends who are twins. The name of the elder twin is $$$A$$$, which consists of $$$N$$$ characters. While the name of the younger twin is $$$B$$$, which consists of $$$M$$$ characters. It is known that $$$N \\leq M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to call each of them with a nickname. For the elder twin, you want to pick any permutation of $$$A$$$ as the nickname. For the younger twin, you want to remove exactly $$$M - N$$$ characters from any permutation of $$$B$$$. Denote the nicknames of the elder twin and the younger twin as $$$A'$$$ and $$$B'$$$, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want the nicknames to satisfy the following requirement. For each $$$i$$$ that satisfies $$$1 \\leq i \\leq N$$$, $$$B'_i$$$ must be equal to either $$$A'_i$$$ or the next letter that follows alphabetically after $$$A'_i$$$ (if such a next letter exists)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine the number of different pairs of nicknames $$$(A', B')$$$ that satisfy the requirement. Two pairs of nicknames are considered different if at least one of the nicknames are different. As the result might be large, find the answer modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line consists of two integers $$$N$$$ $$$M$$$ ($$$1 \\leq N \\leq M \\leq 200\\,000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line consists of a string $$$A$$$ of length $$$N$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line consists of a string $$$B$$$ of length $$$M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All strings consist of only upper-case letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer representing number of different pairs $$$(A', B')$$$ that satisfy the requirement, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 4\nAMA\nANAB\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 8\nBINUS\nBINANUSA\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":